    "name": "Out of the Fog",
    "steam_appid": 3464690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity and a refusal to believe in the myth of the mysterious faceless creature, you venture into eerie, abandoned locations to uncover the truth. But what starts as a thrill-seeking adventure soon spirals into a nightmare as the legend proves horrifyingly real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/7a6e82cc98aba48519a3a4a04a283df6.avif?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/b66137e6146fb7cda10d20225147d6c8.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend or face the horrors alone. Work together to explore dark environments, find the drawings, burn them, and evade the mysterious faceless creature as he hunts you in real time. Will you make it out alive together, or will fear tear you apart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/396c848c4d9d2cf22c0e9d6f86d64ba4.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hauntingly detailed locations, from a overgrown forest to a derelict factory. Each area is filled with eerie sounds, unsettling visuals, and environmental storytelling that will send shivers down your spine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/fd1824a7beb4905931d069f5effd0605.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious faceless creature isn\u2019t just a passive observer \u2014 he adapts to your actions. Stay too long in one place, and he\u2019ll find you. Keep moving, but don\u2019t lose track of your objectives, or you\u2019ll fall prey to his relentless pursuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/a78afdefad2c7d61f84455bb145a427b.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the dark mystery behind the legend. Collect notes scattered throughout the world to learn why the mysterious faceless creature exists \u2014 and why you might be his next victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/dad63437628e7dc7a5110dc851c0e392.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tension builds as resources are scarce, and hiding spots are never guaranteed. Every decision matters, and one wrong move could mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/3467018799b0bd844270ed9d7271fc4c.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to put your skepticism to the test? The truth lies within the darkness, but so does the danger. Gather your courage, grab your flashlight, and prepare to face your fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/4f28e8347b8390dbadc46c3ca709eda1.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity and a refusal to believe in the myth of the mysterious faceless creature, you venture into eerie, abandoned locations to uncover the truth. But what starts as a thrill-seeking adventure soon spirals into a nightmare as the legend proves horrifyingly real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/7a6e82cc98aba48519a3a4a04a283df6.avif?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/b66137e6146fb7cda10d20225147d6c8.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend or face the horrors alone. Work together to explore dark environments, find the drawings, burn them, and evade the mysterious faceless creature as he hunts you in real time. Will you make it out alive together, or will fear tear you apart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/396c848c4d9d2cf22c0e9d6f86d64ba4.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hauntingly detailed locations, from a overgrown forest to a derelict factory. Each area is filled with eerie sounds, unsettling visuals, and environmental storytelling that will send shivers down your spine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/fd1824a7beb4905931d069f5effd0605.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious faceless creature isn\u2019t just a passive observer \u2014 he adapts to your actions. Stay too long in one place, and he\u2019ll find you. Keep moving, but don\u2019t lose track of your objectives, or you\u2019ll fall prey to his relentless pursuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/a78afdefad2c7d61f84455bb145a427b.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the dark mystery behind the legend. Collect notes scattered throughout the world to learn why the mysterious faceless creature exists \u2014 and why you might be his next victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/dad63437628e7dc7a5110dc851c0e392.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tension builds as resources are scarce, and hiding spots are never guaranteed. Every decision matters, and one wrong move could mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/3467018799b0bd844270ed9d7271fc4c.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to put your skepticism to the test? The truth lies within the darkness, but so does the danger. Gather your courage, grab your flashlight, and prepare to face your fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464690/extras/4f28e8347b8390dbadc46c3ca709eda1.webp?t=1747928376\" width=608 height=54 /></span></p>",
